          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilamukha lia Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli Esabato yaawa, Maria Makatalena, Maria maawe owa Yakobo, ne Solome bakula kamafura kaunya bulayi khucha khuakha kumulaambo kwa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyanga ne esoa chumapili bacha khu siliindwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balikho ne bacha bareebana bali, “Naanu olakhupiringisilia libaale lirure emuliango we siliindwa?” (Liaba liboofu lukali.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli balola babona bali libaale liarusiibweyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bengila mu siliindwa babonamo omusoleeli ne ekhaale kumukhono kumuseecha, afwarire engubo ewaanga mala besiindukha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusoleeli chana ababoolela ali, “Mukhesiindukha tawe, manyile ndi mulikho muenja Yesu owe Nasareti, niye babambile. Se ali ano tawe, alamusiibwe! Lola ano niio baamureere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 26.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 14.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nono khemuche muboolele babeeka bewe, alala ne Petero yesi muli, ‘Alikho acha Kalilaya oleyo enywe ne mukholayo tawe’, ebweeneyo mulamubona nga nilwo amuboolela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio barura mu ng'ani chimbilo sikila baba mu bireengo ne khukhwesiindukha mala khuboolelakho omundu yesi yesi tawe, sikila baba ne buuri bukali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu abonekhela Maria Makatalena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa Yesu khulamukha khukhwama mu lifwa makhelebeende chumapili, anyoa abonekhela Maria Makatalena niye arusiamo bisieeno saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria chana acha aboolela babaandu ba babechanga naye. Baba basooma ne khulila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga baulila naboola ali Yesu ali omulamu lundi amubone, se bamusuubila tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu abonekhela babeeka babili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wakano, Yesu abonekhela babeeka bewe babili mu ngila ekabukhane ne balikho ne bacha mu birekere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakobola baboolela babasiaabwe ne kakhali se babasuubila tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu abonekhela babeeka ekhumi na mulala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumaliilikha Yesu abonekhela babeeka bewe ekhumi na mulala nga baba ne balikho balia. Abayibila, sikila se baba ne lisuubila tawe, lundi sikila baba ne kimiooyo kimilume se basuubila abo ba bamubona enyuma we khulamukha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 1.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ababoolela ali, “Cha mu sibala sioosi mala mwilwache Elomo Endayi khu buli mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi osuubila mala abatiisibwe alaonisibwa, ne oyo okhasuubila tawe, alakhalakilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuubili balaebwa bunyali bwe khukhola kamayia, bakharusie bisieeno mu lisina liase. Bakhalomalome mu ndimi chimbia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakhatiila chindemu namwe banywa buchiba, se bakhanyoole butinyu bwosi bwosi tawe, balira kamakhono kabwe khu balwale mala baone.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu abukulwa khucha mwikulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.9+ACT.1.10+ACT.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 1.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enyuma wo Mwami Yesu khulomaloma ne nabo abukulwa aniina mwikulu mala ekhala kumukhono kumuseecha kwa Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babeeka bewe bacha belwacha buli abuundu, mala Omwami akhola kimilimo nabo, ne khukhwekesia bali kamelwacho ke burume kabwe kali ka ng'ali khuloondekhana ne kamayia niko bakholanga.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kamakaluukhasia malala ke khaale se kali ne chinyilili chino tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhasi bacha khu Petero ne basaale bewe mala bababoolela mu bwimbi koosi niko baboolelwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wakano Yesu omwene arumikhira babeeka bewe khukhwama ebukwe khukhwola mumbo khulandisia burume bwewe butakatifu bwe buonia bwa mindali.]",
          "type": "text",
